"Fast Curve: Reach half-size at 1/3rds.\n"
"Linear: Reach half-size at half the game.\n"
"Slow Curve: Reach half-size at 2/3rds.\n"
"Very Slow Curve: Reach half-size at 3/4ths.\n"
