msgid "Affects how late in the level a closet can be found."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1812
msgid "Weapon tech level"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1824
msgid ""
"Influences weapons that marines spawn with:\n"
"\n"
"Very Low tech: Clearing demonic invasion with nothing but pistols and harsh language\n"
"Low tech: Pistols, with some rare chainguns and shotguns\n"
"Mid tech: Shotguns/Chainguns with some rare pistols, super shotguns, rocket launchers and plasma rifles\n"
"High tech: Rocket launchers/Plasma rifles with some rare BFGs, super shotguns and chainguns\n"
"Mix it up: Any weapon goes, let the dice decide!\n"
"BFG Fiesta: BFG only, cyberdemons beware!\n"
"Progressive: Marines start with pistols and get more powerful weapons through the WAD"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1831
msgid "Trigger Type"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1835
msgid ""
"Influences the trigger that activates marines.\n"
"\n"
"Sight: Marine closet activates once it can 'see' the player.\n"
"Range: Closet activates when player is close enough, even if behind wall.\n"
"Close Range: same as range except requires player to be really really close.\n"
"Map Start: Closets are active on map start."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1843
msgid "Marine Color"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1847
msgid "Lets you choose the color of marines, including option for random color per marine."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1854
msgid "Friendly Fire"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1858
msgid ""
"By default marines do no damage to player. However that means their use their own version of puffs and projectiles.\n"
"If this is enabled marines can damage player and original puffs and projectiles are used making them affected by mods that replace those.\n"
"Additionally if self damage variant is chosen marines can still get hurt by exploding barrels and such"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1865
msgid "Player Damage Immunity"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1869
msgid "If enabled, marines will never take damage from player owned sources."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1875
msgid "Weapon Sprites"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1879
msgid ""
"By default marines use default player sprite.\n"
"If this is enabled, marines will use special sprites according to weapon they carry.\n"
"With merge option sprites will be merged into oblige wad, otherwise they need to be loaded separately."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1886
msgid "Monster Quantity Multiplier"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1890
msgid "Influences number of monsters in rooms with a marine closet."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1897
msgid "Monster Strength Modifier"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1901
msgid "If set, this strength setting is used in the room with marine closet instead of normal one."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1909
msgid "Strong Marines"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1913
msgid "Influences whether marines are as accurate and rapid firing as player, or are weaker."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1920
msgid "Followers"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1924
msgid ""
"By default marines try to follow the player if they have nothing else to do but would otherwise prioritize chasing enemies, and are also unable to follow player through rough terrain.\n"
"If this is enabled marines will much harder prioritize following player and will teleport if they are too far away."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1930
msgid "Follow Distance"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1937
msgid "If marines are followers, the maximum allowed distance they are allowed to stray before being teleported to the player."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1943
msgid "Allow in Gotchas"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1947
msgid "Allows or disallows marine closets to spawn on gotchas and boss generator levels."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1953
msgid "Death Messages"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1957
msgid "If enabled, will print a message in message log whenever a marine dies. Guilt-induced adds longer obituary text."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1961
msgid "In Secret Rooms"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gzdoom_marine_closet.lua:1965
msgid "If enabled, allowed marine closets to be built in secret rooms."
msgstr ""
